{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:eedee53b782242fa","name":"Double-Bladed Lightsaber","source":{"id":"source:reference-eedee53b782242fa","title":"Double-Bladed Lightsaber","revision":18112,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:36:28Z","sha256":"d26f9b5b6eac6467d47dfda3fa9e8c125fa396bdf03eeccfcc402bf64069be6d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18112","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Double-Bladed%20Lightsaber&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-eedee53b782242fa","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Double-Bladed Lightsaber consists of two Lightsabers fused at their hilts. These weapons are rare and require even greater skill to wield than a single-bladed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". One or both blades can be ignited at once.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With both blades ignited, a Double-Bladed Lightsaber is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Weapon"},". You can attack with both ends of the weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", but both attack rolls take a -10 penalty (although certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," can reduce these penalties). A Double-Bladed Lightsaber requires two special ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cells"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cells"}," to operate (the cost of each is ten times the price of an ordinary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"},", but it lasts almost indefinitely).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 7,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d8/2d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy and Slashing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," Can be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
